# Phase 2 workflow

## Branches

- Day-to-day work: feature branch → **PR into `v2`** (not `main`, not `v1.0`).
- Releases only: PR **`v2` → `main`** once a deploy target exists for `main`.
- `v1.0` is production/Pages hotfixes only — no Phase 2 features.

## Increments

Ship one vertical slice per PR (contracts → UI → e2e → recordings). Prefer a thin end-to-end path over a wide incomplete layer. Read Phase 2 brief before architectural changes:

`Documents/Personal Reading & Knowledge Platform/Phases/Phase 2 - Synchronization and Continuity.md`

## TDD (required)

1. Write or extend a failing unit/integration test for the behaviour.
2. Implement the minimum to pass.
3. Refactor behind green tests.
4. Do not open a PR with new behaviour that has no automated coverage.

Prefer co-located `*.test.ts` next to the module under test (Vitest).

## PR checklist

Every Phase 2 PR must:

- [ ] Target **`v2`**
- [ ] Include unit tests for the new behaviour (TDD)
- [ ] Include or update Playwright coverage under `e2e/phase2/`
- [ ] Produce named screen recordings in `e2e/artifacts/pr-videos/` + `manifest.json` via `npm run test:e2e:phase2` (CI uploads + comments)
- [ ] Keep cloud behind `VITE_CLOUD_ENABLED` — logged-out/local path unchanged when off
- [ ] Never commit secrets, tokens, or `.env` with credentials

## Local stack

```bash
npm run docker:up      # Postgres + API :3000
npm run dev:cloud      # Vite with cloud features
npm test               # unit
npm run test:e2e:phase2  # e2e + PR videos
```
